before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

int main(void) {
 int *p = malloc(sizeof *p);
 if (p == NULL) { return 1; }
 *p = 12;
 printf("%d\n", *p);
 free(p);
}
```

